    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-strangling-vapors",
    "description": "<p>You release a globe of steam thick enough to choke anyone in its area. Select a point you can see within range, and generate a 10-foot radius sphere of steam that is difficult to breathe in. Creatures that need to breathe that begin their turn in the globe must make a Constitution saving throw gaining 1 rank of Exhaustion on a failure.</p>\n<p>As a Bonus action on your turn, you can move this globe to another point within 30 feet of its current position.</p>",
